3","role":0,"stats":[67,74,49,38,65,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1007205","helmet":"WP1019605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1072","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[67,74,49,38,65,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1007205","helmet":"WP1019605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[67,74,49,38,65,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1007205","helmet":"WP1019605"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"吴国武将，东吴大将蒋钦之子。凭借父亲的功勋荫庇，早年进入仕途，其军事生涯始于家族背景的助力。蒋钦去世后，蒋壹受封宣城侯，在夷陵之战领兵抵抗刘备，又跟随大军赶往江陵一带抵抗魏军，临阵战死。蒋壹死后，其弟蒋休带其位。","tc":"吳國武將，東吳大將蔣欽之子。憑借父親的功勛蔭庇，早年進入仕途，其軍事生涯始于家族背景的助力。蔣欽去世后，蔣壹受封宣城侯，在夷陵之戰領兵抵抗劉備，又跟隨大軍趕往江陵一帶抵抗魏軍，臨陣戰死。蔣壹死后，其弟蔣休帶其位。","en":"An officer of Wu, the son of the Eastern Wu general Jiang Qin. Benefiting from his father's meritorious service, he entered officialdom early, his military career launched with the support of his family background. After Jiang Qin's death, Jiang Yi was enfeoffed as Marquis of Xuancheng. He led troops to resist Liu Bei during the Battle of Yiling, then followed the main army to the Jiangling area to defend against Wei forces, falling in battle. After his death, his younger brother Jiang Xiu succeeded him.","jp":"呉の武将で、東呉の大将・蒋欽の子。父の功績による恩蔭によって若くして仕官し、家族の後ろ盾を得て軍歴を歩み始めた。蒋欽の死後、蒋壱は宣城侯に封じられ、夷陵の戦いでは兵を率いて劉備に抵抗し、さらに大軍に従って江陵一帯へと駆けつけ魏軍を迎撃したが、陣中で戦死した。蒋壱の死後、弟の蒋休がその位を継いだ。","kr":"오나라의 무장이자 동오의 대장 장흠의 아들입니다. 부친의 공훈 덕분에 일찍이 관직에 나아갔으며, 가문의 배경을 발판 삼아 군사 경력을 시작했습니다. 장흠이 세상을 떠난 뒤 선성후에 봉해졌고, 이릉 전투에서 군사를 이끌고 유비에게 맞섰습니다. 이후 대군을 따라 강릉 일대로 가 위군을 막아내던 중 진중에서 전사했습니다. 장일이 죽은 후에는 동생 장휴가 그 뒤를 이었습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1013002","remark":"","surname":"蒋","surnameTc":"蔣","surnameEn":"Jiang","surnameJp":"蒋","surnameKr":"장","surnameOther":"","name":"壹","nameTc":"壹","nameEn":"Yi","nameJp":"壱","nameKr":"일","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"蒋壹","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"208","city":"CS1072","gender":"0","rule":"67","force":"74","wise":"49","politics":"38","charm":"65","will":"70","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"4","politicsTalent":"3","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"8","weaponMaster":"31/78/31/31/31/16/50/31","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1006205","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4400","battleSoulPoint":"5400","debateSoulPoint":"2400","strategy":"","strategy2":"1001105","professions":"1/0/1/0/0/3/1/0/0/0/0/0/1/2/2/0/0/0/0/1/0/3/1/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"3","compatible":"80","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"189","show":"208","death":"222","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"0","weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1007205","helmet":"WP1019605","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/1;1/1;3/1;9/1;12/1;25/1;30/1","father":"WJ10078/0","mother":"","children":"","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0","endVIPYear":"0","description":"吴国武将，东吴大将蒋钦之子。凭借父亲的功勋荫庇，早年进入仕途，其军事生涯始于家族背景的助力。蒋钦去世后，蒋壹受封宣城侯，在夷陵之战领兵抵抗刘备，又跟随大军赶往江陵一带抵抗魏军，临阵战死。蒋壹死后，其弟蒋休带其位。","descriptionTc":"吳國武將，東吳大將蔣欽之子。憑借父親的功勛蔭庇，